# Quantum Updater — project instructions

Follow user-level `team-workflow` and this file.

- Tracker: `tracker.html` (update same turn as plan/status). Decisions: `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Security: `docs/SECURITY_AUDIT.md` + `docs/Code_and_Application_Security_Audit_Prompt.md`. Picture: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Team: `docs/TEAM.md`.
- Test: packaged Windows app on this PC (`dist\QuantumUpdater\` or Releases zip). No website staging copy.
- Branch for Windows: `channel/windows`.
- Release asset: `QuantumUpdater-Windows.zip` (full onedir). Never publish a lone onedir bootloader as the install file.
- Accepted direction: C# + WinUI 3 (ADR 041). Python app stays reference until Phase 1 WinUI is accepted.
- Owner later list for decisions; do not idle the queue.
